{"availability":"available","full":"alexander-bain/bainluck","name":"bainluck","description":"Prediction market discovery platform — translates betting odds into intuitive probabilities","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":2,"created":"2026-01-27T05:27:34Z","updated":"2026-10-16T21:26:14Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://bainluck.com","topics":["fastapi","nextjs","prediction-markets","probability","real-time","sports-odds","swiftui"],"demo":"https://bainluck.com/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T21:33:05.528Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T21:33:05.528Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T21:33:05.528Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-04T08:16:26.320Z","stars":1,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-06T15:44:02.067Z","stars":1,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-08T16:03:52.236Z","stars":1,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-11T00:23:32.020Z","stars":1,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-16T21:33:05.528Z","stars":1,"forks":2}],"technologies":["Next.js","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Probability, not betting. The world's honest guess about what happens next.","Bain Luck aggregates prediction markets, sportsbook lines, and statistical models into one blended probability per question. You always see a probability like \"60%\", never a price like \"-150\" or \"+3000\". It started with sports and now covers politics, economics, entertainment, tech, geopolitics, and weather.","Live Site · Discover Feed · Calibration · API Docs"],"features":["Discover feed: ranked, story-grouped prediction cards across every category, with Today's Challenge","Probability-first event pages: blended win probability charts, market maps, player props, championship paths","Cross-source aggregation: Kalshi, Polymarket, ESPN, DataGolf, MLB Stats API, and a sportsbook consensus (12+ books via The Odds API), blended into one probability per question","Championship grids: visual probability grids for NBA, NHL, MLB, NFL, and Golf","Multi-p